{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.80.194.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1422515644,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"964037b2b6d70bd6464caeeef6073329","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome newbie brides, and Congrats ALL on beautiful destination weddings!!! you&#039;re already all winners with the amazing backdrop the tropical beach settings provide for very memorable wedding photos, so well done :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are a few examples to show what I am talking about......&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152914104764487.1073741916.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10830782_10152914109594487_4363129065466496206_o.jpg\" alt=\"10830782_10152914109594487_4363129065466\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10869633_10152914108874487_7581345740016741560_o.jpg\" alt=\"10869633_10152914108874487_7581345740016\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10847321_10152914111399487_4046095197177421328_o.jpg\" alt=\"10847321_10152914111399487_4046095197177\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...and here are some guest shots captured a recent &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152904409984487.1073741915.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Secrets Silversands Wedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10861081_10152904413314487_4292472651272315123_o.jpg\" alt=\"10861081_10152904413314487_4292472651272\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1511889_10152904415139487_1868773460806788216_o.jpg\" alt=\"1511889_10152904415139487_18687734608067\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone wonderful journeys - where ever you are in your process... and all the best going forward,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;p.s. CONGRATS calgarybride2015 on your wedding a few days ago!!! .....would love to see photos when you get them....following your planning process on these threads, and Linc being from Calgary before heading here, makes it feel like we&#039;re ole friends.....hugs n Congrats!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;btw, this is what Calgary looked like during a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153008969919487.1073741917.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Newlywed Photo Session at Eau Clair&lt;\/a&gt; Linc captured a few wks ago.....which shows its&#039; own beauty too :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10918949_10153008973709487_3474423726698694734_o.jpg\" alt=\"10918949_10153008973709487_3474423726698\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10530526_10153008973049487_5281973295252683133_o.jpg\" alt=\"10530526_10153008973049487_5281973295252\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884580,"PostDate":1422514999,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome newbie brides, and Congrats ALL on beautiful destination weddings!!! you're already all winners with the amazing backdrop the tropical beach settings provide for very memorable wedding photos, so well done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are a few examples to show what I am talking about......<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152914104764487.1073741916.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10830782_10152914109594487_4363129065466496206_o.jpg\" alt=\"10830782_10152914109594487_4363129065466\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10869633_10152914108874487_7581345740016741560_o.jpg\" alt=\"10869633_10152914108874487_7581345740016\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10847321_10152914111399487_4046095197177421328_o.jpg\" alt=\"10847321_10152914111399487_4046095197177\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...and here are some guest shots captured a recent <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152904409984487.1073741915.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secrets Silversands Wedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10861081_10152904413314487_4292472651272315123_o.jpg\" alt=\"10861081_10152904413314487_4292472651272\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1511889_10152904415139487_1868773460806788216_o.jpg\" alt=\"1511889_10152904415139487_18687734608067\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone wonderful journeys - where ever you are in your process... and all the best going forward,<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>p.s. CONGRATS calgarybride2015 on your wedding a few days ago!!! .....would love to see photos when you get them....following your planning process on these threads, and Linc being from Calgary before heading here, makes it feel like we're ole friends.....hugs n Congrats!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>btw, this is what Calgary looked like during a <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153008969919487.1073741917.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Newlywed Photo Session at Eau Clair<\/a> Linc captured a few wks ago.....which shows its' own beauty too <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10918949_10153008973709487_3474423726698694734_o.jpg\" alt=\"10918949_10153008973709487_3474423726698\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10530526_10153008973049487_5281973295252683133_o.jpg\" alt=\"10530526_10153008973049487_5281973295252\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d52acb2bcfd15145d45a556c8d88c9bd","RawContent":"@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] no you were of help.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884594,"PostDate":1422517446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> no you were of help. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.1.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f64da6aae0d1c6becf62088cc1a81f0","RawContent":"Is anyone thinking of giving their guests flip flops? And if so how did you know their size? Ask beforehand? I always thought this idea was cute and thoughyf for a beach wedding","Attachments":[],"Id":1885861,"PostDate":1423559552,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Is anyone thinking of giving their guests flip flops? And if so how did you know their size? Ask beforehand? I always thought this idea was cute and thoughyf for a beach wedding \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423547566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02c5c49cf38e48897995f78234643faf","RawContent":"@[member=\"cruisebride2016\"] I love the idea of no wedding party, I think we&#039;re going to do the same. \n\n\n@Cableove11 sounds like a logistical nightmare.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887556,"PostDate":1424888792,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281378\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281378-cruisebride2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cruisebride2016<\/span><\/a> I love the idea of no wedding party, I think we're going to do the same. <br><br>\n@Cableove11 sounds like a logistical nightmare.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424028109,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1424542147","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":291,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c46c083128c10a148827b95ebb6fd0c7","RawContent":"This is a great topic that&#039;s been on my mind! Our beach wedding is at 4 and the outdoor reception starts at 5. I want our guests to be comfortable but It&#039;s a wedding so I feel shorts are too casual. I am trying to be fair and happy :)\n\n\nAlso curious as to what shoes other brides are wearing on the sand \/ lawn? My MOH wants to wear heels but I think I will fall over Lol!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887628,"PostDate":1424954114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a great topic that's been on my mind! Our beach wedding is at 4 and the outdoor reception starts at 5. I want our guests to be comfortable but It's a wedding so I feel shorts are too casual. I am trying to be fair and happy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nAlso curious as to what shoes other brides are wearing on the sand \/ lawn? My MOH wants to wear heels but I think I will fall over Lol!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sandra_co8@icloud.com","IpAddress":"50.162.188.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421678470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sandraco8","Id":281796,"Name":"Sandraco8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.53.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1425177146,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"af2fc1ff71f93c88fce4ae5ad56a7638","RawContent":"Idk I say (my opinion) shorts could be fine. After all your having a tropical destination wedding. I&#039;m sure no one would wear jean shorts. Women probably wouldn&#039;t even consider shorts. They probably would want to wart dresses. Now if you you are having an inside ceremony and venue under air conditioning it might be suggest dress or dress casual if specifying your guests attire is of importance. Also time of year and time a day have a lot to do with the elements and what your guests are comfortable with if it outdoors. \n\n\nI am wearing barefoot sandals for ceremony on beach and ballet slip ons for dance supply store for reception!\n\nCongrats!\nThunder thumbs gets me every time! Ignore my typing! ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1887857,"PostDate":1425177211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Idk I say (my opinion) shorts could be fine. After all your having a tropical destination wedding. I'm sure no one would wear jean shorts. Women probably wouldn't even consider shorts. They probably would want to wart dresses. Now if you you are having an inside ceremony and venue under air conditioning it might be suggest dress or dress casual if specifying your guests attire is of importance. Also time of year and time a day have a lot to do with the elements and what your guests are comfortable with if it outdoors. <br><br>\nI am wearing barefoot sandals for ceremony on beach and ballet slip ons for dance supply store for reception!<br>\nCongrats!<br \/>Thunder thumbs gets me every time! Ignore my typing! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.53.13.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"537386adfb91f5ab24354a9af436928a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not completely opposed to shorts (as long as they are dressy shorts). To be honest, i&#039;d prefer that the guests dress in pants\/wedding appropriate attire, but my ceremony is being held on a terrace and not the beach. I guess it also depends on the setting.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887903,"PostDate":1425219348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm not completely opposed to shorts (as long as they are dressy shorts). To be honest, i'd prefer that the guests dress in pants\/wedding appropriate attire, but my ceremony is being held on a terrace and not the beach. I guess it also depends on the setting.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1419409014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1425000950","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.49.241.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f811ba0485d429f2ef7421cd283cb39","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The first time I went to a DW as a guest I was a bit stressed about what to wear (more so than when I would attend a local wedding). I didn&#039;t want to seem to casual but I also didn&#039;t want to show up too dressy (since it was on the beach and all).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When we decided to have a DW we wanted to help our guests with some suggestions. We don&#039;t really care what they wear as long as it is comfortable and they are not topless in their swim trunks lol! We simply put on our website \"Beach formal attire\" (to be honest I didn&#039;t know this was a term until I started asking around and googled it haha) and said no swimsuits or coverups please. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887905,"PostDate":1425220008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The first time I went to a DW as a guest I was a bit stressed about what to wear (more so than when I would attend a local wedding). I didn't want to seem to casual but I also didn't want to show up too dressy (since it was on the beach and all).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When we decided to have a DW we wanted to help our guests with some suggestions. We don't really care what they wear as long as it is comfortable and they are not topless in their swim trunks lol! We simply put on our website \"Beach formal attire\" (to be honest I didn't know this was a term until I started asking around and googled it haha) and said no swimsuits or coverups please. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415518711,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"499b6dfd2c2fcc8d780d10d807903269","RawContent":"[quote name=\"snswedding2016\" post=\"1887905\" timestamp=\"1425248808\"]\nThe first time I went to a DW as a guest I was a bit stressed about what to wear (more so than when I would attend a local wedding). I didn&#039;t want to seem to casual but I also didn&#039;t want to show up too dressy (since it was on the beach and all).\n\nWhen we decided to have a DW we wanted to help our guests with some suggestions. We don&#039;t really care what they wear as long as it is comfortable and they are not topless in their swim trunks lol! We simply put on our website \"Beach formal attire\" (to be honest I didn&#039;t know this was a term until I started asking around and googled it haha) and said no swimsuits or coverups please. :)[\/quote]We said no swimsuits. As suggestions we said a nice pair of shorts or a sun dress. I feel bad for the men that wore pants because it was hotter than heck. I had sweat running down my legs in my dress. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887917,"PostDate":1425227484,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>snswedding2016, on 01 March 2015 - 02:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>The first time I went to a DW as a guest I was a bit stressed about what to wear (more so than when I would attend a local wedding). I didn't want to seem to casual but I also didn't want to show up too dressy (since it was on the beach and all).<br><br>\nWhen we decided to have a DW we wanted to help our guests with some suggestions. We don't really care what they wear as long as it is comfortable and they are not topless in their swim trunks lol! We simply put on our website \"Beach formal attire\" (to be honest I didn't know this was a term until I started asking around and googled it haha) and said no swimsuits or coverups please. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe said no swimsuits. As suggestions we said a nice pair of shorts or a sun dress. I feel bad for the men that wore pants because it was hotter than heck. I had sweat running down my legs in my dress. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78696,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca0416604e0a93864d190c1204a3f8ac","RawContent":"I&#039;m adopting what someone said here.  \"Whatever you would wear to a nice restaurant.\" Of course when my mother asked and I told her this she needed clarification.  \"A restaurant here or down there?\" Ha! I think it still gets the point across.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887923,"PostDate":1425228657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm adopting what someone said here.  \"Whatever you would wear to a nice restaurant.\" Of course when my mother asked and I told her this she needed clarification.  \"A restaurant here or down there?\" Ha! I think it still gets the point across.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424028109,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1424542147","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":291,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":25,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
