{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":480,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1872466,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279919,"Name":"AMD","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279919.jpg?_r=1421410763","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1411223670,"LastPoster":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1888056,"PostDate":1425311109,"PostContent":"A newbie starting out reading out the Barcelo Maya. Great info thanks!","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandabeard@trentu.ca","IpAddress":"99.236.77.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425292862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amandalynn","Id":282295,"Name":"amandalynn","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.8.72.153","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5080b423ad020b7fa65dd39c58ea9de1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! Im trying to decide between Destination wedding at Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe and Moon Palace Golf and Spa Resort. They both seem like beautiful locations, but my travel agent is giving me a price of about $200 cheaper for my guests stay a 3 nights at Barcelo...so trying to decide if I should save my guests the money, or go for the nicer looking wedding package at Moon Palace. Anyone have suggestions or thoughts on this?!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872466,"PostDate":1411223670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! Im trying to decide between Destination wedding at Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe and Moon Palace Golf and Spa Resort. They both seem like beautiful locations, but my travel agent is giving me a price of about $200 cheaper for my guests stay a 3 nights at Barcelo...so trying to decide if I should save my guests the money, or go for the nicer looking wedding package at Moon Palace. Anyone have suggestions or thoughts on this?!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adriannedobbs@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.8.72.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411222747,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279919.jpg?_r=1421410763","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AMD","Id":279919,"Name":"AMD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cc16ad5158c6365be198881e6908f3a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have no advice on one resort over another as I didn&#039;t price any of these resorts out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Although I totally understand where you are coming from with respect to helping your guests out price wise. &amp;nbsp;Price point for our guests was HUGE in our decision and we would cross some resorts off the list SOLELY based on price. &amp;nbsp;We didn&#039;t want to price people out of coming to our wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I suggest you look at the overall cost for your guests. &amp;nbsp;What was your initial price point you thought would be reasonable to ask them to pay? &amp;nbsp;Does that extra $200 still fit well or does it really push the boundaries? &amp;nbsp;(ie, our price point was $1500, but we ended up booking for $1565. &amp;nbsp;Still well within a reasonable amount). &amp;nbsp;If you think the added $200 still makes the package reasonable, then I say go for it. &amp;nbsp;IF price point is that important to you -- if your guests price weighs on your mind, but isn&#039;t near the top of your list then I say just pick whatever one you and your fiance are in love with.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know at the end of the day it is your wedding, but I think guests appreciate you consider their costs as well. &amp;nbsp;$200 isn&#039;t a terribly large number so you are probably safe either way.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872509,"PostDate":1411287929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have no advice on one resort over another as I didn't price any of these resorts out.<\/p>\n<p>Although I totally understand where you are coming from with respect to helping your guests out price wise. \u00a0Price point for our guests was HUGE in our decision and we would cross some resorts off the list SOLELY based on price. \u00a0We didn't want to price people out of coming to our wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I suggest you look at the overall cost for your guests. \u00a0What was your initial price point you thought would be reasonable to ask them to pay? \u00a0Does that extra $200 still fit well or does it really push the boundaries? \u00a0(ie, our price point was $1500, but we ended up booking for $1565. \u00a0Still well within a reasonable amount). \u00a0If you think the added $200 still makes the package reasonable, then I say go for it. \u00a0IF price point is that important to you -- if your guests price weighs on your mind, but isn't near the top of your list then I say just pick whatever one you and your fiance are in love with.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know at the end of the day it is your wedding, but I think guests appreciate you consider their costs as well. \u00a0$200 isn't a terribly large number so you are probably safe either way.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.204.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94ece9920f22f6e4a06ac5ad8df8fb35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, AMD and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you&#039;re sure to find lots of really helpful ideas and suggestions here, so great job on starting out so well :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Both the choices you&#039;re considering would made amazingly beautiful backdrops for your wedding ....as seen in these magical \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at each one (for comparison)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album.&lt;\/a&gt;....with excerpt here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/885885_10152425665299487_7682003709241996331_o.jpg\" alt=\"885885_10152425665299487_768200370924199\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;......with sample photo here:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1403211_10151930926649487_1932540840_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403211_10151930926649487_1932540840_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and planning.....Enjoy the journey!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872625,"PostDate":1411371300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, AMD and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! you're sure to find lots of really helpful ideas and suggestions here, so great job on starting out so well <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Both the choices you're considering would made amazingly beautiful backdrops for your wedding ....as seen in these magical \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at each one (for comparison)\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152425657474487.1073741892.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Palace Wedding Album.<\/a>....with excerpt here:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/885885_10152425665299487_7682003709241996331_o.jpg\" alt=\"885885_10152425665299487_768200370924199\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album<\/a>......with sample photo here:<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1403211_10151930926649487_1932540840_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403211_10151930926649487_1932540840_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and planning.....Enjoy the journey!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.230.214.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ceca39dd56fe38b8e23046c9d5d10b6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you both for your replies!! :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872865,"PostDate":1411468398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you both for your replies!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adriannedobbs@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.8.72.153","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411222747,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279919.jpg?_r=1421410763","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AMD","Id":279919,"Name":"AMD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9190ce82d4113295fd5299b5cb5a7a88","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My wedding is booked at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. I did not really compare prices when booking (I have family who has stayed at this specific Barcelo and just absolutely loved it, so I went with this choice). The only thing with the Barcelo&#039;s is they do charge outside vendor fees. ($500 for photographer, $150 for make up\/styling team, and $105\/hr for outside DJ). I have chose outside vendors for all three of these choices. This resort is great though because it offers tons rooms with different prices which really helps our guests out. Any questions feel free to ask! My date is 5\/15\/2015!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874262,"PostDate":1412446751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My wedding is booked at the Barcelo in Riviera Maya. I did not really compare prices when booking (I have family who has stayed at this specific Barcelo and just absolutely loved it, so I went with this choice). The only thing with the Barcelo's is they do charge outside vendor fees. ($500 for photographer, $150 for make up\/styling team, and $105\/hr for outside DJ). I have chose outside vendors for all three of these choices. This resort is great though because it offers tons rooms with different prices which really helps our guests out. Any questions feel free to ask! My date is 5\/15\/2015!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hoopers2901@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.85.216.127","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1410894788,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279867.jpg?_r=1411696267","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cfinkenbine","Id":279867,"Name":"cfinkenbine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.77.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"74c0ca426eeca645470c712807b9da23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;A newbie starting out reading out the Barcelo Maya. Great info thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888056,"PostDate":1425311109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>A newbie starting out reading out the Barcelo Maya. Great info thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandabeard@trentu.ca","IpAddress":"99.236.77.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425292862,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amandalynn","Id":282295,"Name":"amandalynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d07f6e502c1bfd02be5668a46f8ed93","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Have you taken into consideration that Palace offers resort credits as well? These can be used toward excursions, the spa etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m having&amp;nbsp;mine at Beach Palace and it has a lot to do with the quality of the Palace chains. I&#039;ve been to Moon Palace with my fiance and we had an amazing trip and the ONLY negative thing I could think of was that the resort was a bit too large for our taste, but that&#039;s why we chose Beach Palace for our wedding instead (it&#039;s much smaller). Honestly, you really can&#039;t go wrong with Palace.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888132,"PostDate":1425364621,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Have you taken into consideration that Palace offers resort credits as well? These can be used toward excursions, the spa etc.<\/p>\n<p>I'm having\u00a0mine at Beach Palace and it has a lot to do with the quality of the Palace chains. I've been to Moon Palace with my fiance and we had an amazing trip and the ONLY negative thing I could think of was that the resort was a bit too large for our taste, but that's why we chose Beach Palace for our wedding instead (it's much smaller). Honestly, you really can't go wrong with Palace.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1419409014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1425000950","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.111.26","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78056,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dc96655aff54db8fab103a60274a003","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, amandalynn and welcome to the threads!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We just got back from a Barcelo wedding that was as beautiful as all the rest we&#039;ve seen there....here are some examples to show you what I am talking about.....with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153071564624487.1073741920.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Colonial Wedding&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558124571_o.jpg\" alt=\"10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10959138_10153071590769487_5410667727706186018_o.jpg\" alt=\"10959138_10153071590769487_5410667727706\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10428521_10153071605724487_2325571658001632120_n.jpg?oh=f871b4688d82f1c369925179ed8b5221&amp;amp;oe=5589E799&amp;amp;__gda__=1434026383_e545ac16b12d2f4f16ecb69ce03f5e27\" alt=\"10428521_10153071605724487_2325571658001\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your research here and the remarkable journey you&#039;re on....cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888134,"PostDate":1425365556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your upcoming destination wedding, amandalynn and welcome to the threads!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We just got back from a Barcelo wedding that was as beautiful as all the rest we've seen there....here are some examples to show you what I am talking about.....with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153071564624487.1073741920.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Colonial Wedding\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558124571_o.jpg\" alt=\"10865748_10153071584314487_8458616125558\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/10959138_10153071590769487_5410667727706186018_o.jpg\" alt=\"10959138_10153071590769487_5410667727706\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10428521_10153071605724487_2325571658001632120_n.jpg?oh=f871b4688d82f1c369925179ed8b5221&oe=5589E799&__gda__=1434026383_e545ac16b12d2f4f16ecb69ce03f5e27\" alt=\"10428521_10153071605724487_2325571658001\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy your research here and the remarkable journey you're on....cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78056","Title":"Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe Vs, Moon Palace Golf And Spa Resort","LastPostDate":1425365556},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
