{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f5c9d00b596ec099c9daf5a5a8246e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I noticed that there is a Gran Caribe 2014 thread but not one for the Royal. I know alot of the Royal Weddings share Gran Caribe venues but I though it would be nice to have both! I am getting married at The Royal Oct 18, 2014! Ceremony on the beach by the gazebo terrrace, the cocktails on the gazebo terrace and the reception on the Albatros terrace at the Gran Caribe. I am debating on whether to change my cocktail hour location to the villas terrace just in case I do not end up having enough people to fill up the huge space on the Albatross terrace. That ay i would just move the reception to the Villas terrace and put the cocktail hr on the beach. Any thoughts on this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811955,"PostDate":1383641609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I noticed that there is a Gran Caribe 2014 thread but not one for the Royal. I know alot of the Royal Weddings share Gran Caribe venues but I though it would be nice to have both! I am getting married at The Royal Oct 18, 2014! Ceremony on the beach by the gazebo terrrace, the cocktails on the gazebo terrace and the reception on the Albatros terrace at the Gran Caribe. I am debating on whether to change my cocktail hour location to the villas terrace just in case I do not end up having enough people to fill up the huge space on the Albatross terrace. That ay i would just move the reception to the Villas terrace and put the cocktail hr on the beach. Any thoughts on this?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jnmiller0104@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.79.56.91","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1383405783,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274782.jpg?_r=1424274340","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chirobride","Id":274782,"Name":"chirobride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5830b52547450242dc8c761be1c9af5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Also my wedding coordinator is Flora and i was wondering is anyone else has or had her and what their experiences were like along the way. I was just sent email attachments with all of the options and I have to admit I am a little overwhelmed any suggestions on what to tackle first and an approximate timeline in which things should be chosen?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811956,"PostDate":1383641749,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Also my wedding coordinator is Flora and i was wondering is anyone else has or had her and what their experiences were like along the way. I was just sent email attachments with all of the options and I have to admit I am a little overwhelmed any suggestions on what to tackle first and an approximate timeline in which things should be chosen?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jnmiller0104@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.79.56.91","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1383405783,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274782.jpg?_r=1424274340","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chirobride","Id":274782,"Name":"chirobride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"615c6052e114416a8bb437e2776eb51c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, chirobride, and Congrats on your Royal Cancun Wedding next year!!! you&#039;ll find loads of great info here, as well as wonderful advice and support from everyone here......happy research, and hope your Dream Wedding is everything you Wish for.....Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226324\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226324\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226325\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226325\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226326\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226326\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226327\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226327\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226328\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226328\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Photography Is Forever Studios&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"226329\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226329\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1813543,"PostDate":1384028561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, chirobride, and Congrats on your Royal Cancun Wedding next year!!! you'll find loads of great info here, as well as wonderful advice and support from everyone here......happy research, and hope your Dream Wedding is everything you Wish for.....Cheers!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226324\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226324\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226325\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226325\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226326\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226326\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226327\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226327\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226328\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226328\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Photography Is Forever Studios\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"226329\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/226329\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372782757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4d94711cfee7367cba016dd04f714a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi I am also having the events within these two resorts. If you have 60 people I for sure would book the villas terrace.. it would look much nicer if its less people. I would suggest you ask all your guest to confirm their attendance way before the 60 days limit to respond to the hotel since they book pretty fast (the locations) how are you decorating the terrace? im having a hard time to picture decortaions :(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828090,"PostDate":1390383909,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi I am also having the events within these two resorts. If you have 60 people I for sure would book the villas terrace.. it would look much nicer if its less people. I would suggest you ask all your guest to confirm their attendance way before the 60 days limit to respond to the hotel since they book pretty fast (the locations) how are you decorating the terrace? im having a hard time to picture decortaions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378963945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.243.193.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42a54c29b6b80efc5a724bac4ec66905","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have no idea how to add decorations besides whatever will be on the tables. I know we will have a cake table and then a table for the guest book and place cards with maybe a few flowers but besides that I figure the atmosphere can be the d\u00e9cor. I think we are going to leave the reception at the Albatros terrace since it was the best bathrooms and a lagoon and beach view but I am still debating on whether or not to switch the cocktail hour to the villas terrace. The terrace by the gazebo has a built in bar that is really nice now but the space is a little small but I guess that may not be such a bad thing for cocktail hour. Is anyone getting legally married there&amp;gt;? We are having some confusion about the legalities.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832444,"PostDate":1391770116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have no idea how to add decorations besides whatever will be on the tables. I know we will have a cake table and then a table for the guest book and place cards with maybe a few flowers but besides that I figure the atmosphere can be the d\u00e9cor. I think we are going to leave the reception at the Albatros terrace since it was the best bathrooms and a lagoon and beach view but I am still debating on whether or not to switch the cocktail hour to the villas terrace. The terrace by the gazebo has a built in bar that is really nice now but the space is a little small but I guess that may not be such a bad thing for cocktail hour. Is anyone getting legally married there>? We are having some confusion about the legalities.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jnmiller0104@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.79.56.91","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1383405783,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274782.jpg?_r=1424274340","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chirobride","Id":274782,"Name":"chirobride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.250.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"749d616a8dc41428b97465f761b22316","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;Congratulations, the place is beautiful! Here you can see some pictures of these extraordinary Resorts! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/80875798&#039;&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/80875798&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1832554,"PostDate":1391819263,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align:center\">Congratulations, the place is beautiful! Here you can see some pictures of these extraordinary Resorts! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\"><a href='https:\/\/vimeo.com\/80875798' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/vimeo.com\/80875798<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Osvaldo & M\u00f3nica\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">Destination Wedding Photographers<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Cel. (984) 108 7974<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Cel. (984) 135 7173<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">photofeelings@hotmail.com<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">www.photofeelingsrivieramaya.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"photofeelings@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"200.78.138.81","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1356697307,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263581.jpg?_r=1387090683","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PhotoFeelings","Id":263581,"Name":"PhotoFeelings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3501db385784f1e6bf9a71dd0c8fbfa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just a quick reminder that the wedding webinar for Hyatt Zilara is this Saturday, March 1, 2014 @ 9:00am PST! &amp;nbsp;You can register for this &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76171-hyatt-zilara-gran-caribe-wedding-webinar-sat-march-1-900am-pst\/&#039;&gt;webinar HERE!&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835406,"PostDate":1393240135,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just a quick reminder that the wedding webinar for Hyatt Zilara is this Saturday, March 1, 2014 @ 9:00am PST! \u00a0You can register for this <strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76171-hyatt-zilara-gran-caribe-wedding-webinar-sat-march-1-900am-pst\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>webinar HERE!<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com<\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/75243-karisma-diamond-level-5\/\" title=\"Karisma Diamond Level 5\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_8442\/sml_gallery_206696_8442_4984.png' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Karisma Diamond Level 5'  width='200' height='200'  alt='Karisma Diamond Level 5' id='sml_image_view_75243' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/77453-pro-palace-specialist-agent-platinum-sm\/\" title=\"PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm\"><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_2474.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm'  width='200' height='118'  alt='PRO PALACE SPECIALIST AGENT PLATINUM Sm' id='sml_image_view_77453' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137195420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.161.160.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fb0a138da99ec9fa18c45ee615334aa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"chirobride\" post=\"1832444\" timestamp=\"1391798916\"]\nI have no idea how to add decorations besides whatever will be on the tables. I know we will have a cake table and then a table for the guest book and place cards with maybe a few flowers but besides that I figure the atmosphere can be the d\u00e9cor. I think we are going to leave the reception at the Albatros terrace since it was the best bathrooms and a lagoon and beach view but I am still debating on whether or not to switch the cocktail hour to the villas terrace. The terrace by the gazebo has a built in bar that is really nice now but the space is a little small but I guess that may not be such a bad thing for cocktail hour. Is anyone getting legally married there&amp;gt;? We are having some confusion about the legalities.[\/quote]your wedding is around the corner! what did you end up doing? did you keep the locations? when did you have to let them know how many people exactly?","Attachments":[],"Id":1873096,"PostDate":1411627778,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>chirobride, on 07 February 2014 - 10:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have no idea how to add decorations besides whatever will be on the tables. I know we will have a cake table and then a table for the guest book and place cards with maybe a few flowers but besides that I figure the atmosphere can be the d\u00e9cor. I think we are going to leave the reception at the Albatros terrace since it was the best bathrooms and a lagoon and beach view but I am still debating on whether or not to switch the cocktail hour to the villas terrace. The terrace by the gazebo has a built in bar that is really nice now but the space is a little small but I guess that may not be such a bad thing for cocktail hour. Is anyone getting legally married there>? We are having some confusion about the legalities.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>your wedding is around the corner! what did you end up doing? did you keep the locations? when did you have to let them know how many people exactly?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378963945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.59.18.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1415315160,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cabee83681a8bcd7a364b19e24259d73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For brides looking into photographers and videographers to use for their wedding: I used Ivan Luckie for photos and video and while he was very nice, my pictures took 6 months and my video 9 months.&amp;nbsp; The pictures did not have the \"wow factor\" that I would expect for taking that long and the video was very poor in quality--the sound was not consistent throughout, the scenes were choppy, and the camera shook many times making it look like an amateur video, not to mention the fact that it took 9 months to get it.&amp;nbsp; All in all, I would not recommend them for these reasons--you pay a lot of money for these services and to take this long to receive the finished product and not even be absolutely thrilled with the finished product is not worth it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877907,"PostDate":1415313688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For brides looking into photographers and videographers to use for their wedding: I used Ivan Luckie for photos and video and while he was very nice, my pictures took 6 months and my video 9 months.\u00a0 The pictures did not have the \"wow factor\" that I would expect for taking that long and the video was very poor in quality--the sound was not consistent throughout, the scenes were choppy, and the camera shook many times making it look like an amateur video, not to mention the fact that it took 9 months to get it.\u00a0 All in all, I would not recommend them for these reasons--you pay a lot of money for these services and to take this long to receive the finished product and not even be absolutely thrilled with the finished product is not worth it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cwillette@familylawcolorado.com","IpAddress":"70.59.18.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415310327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beachgirl14","Id":281027,"Name":"beachgirl14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.73.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75517,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"604676fc7d37c203df73c5e55fc74936","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thx for sharing your review, beachgirl14 - it&#039;s what makes this forum such a valuable planning resource :) would love to see some of your wedding photos - if you have time to share.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s a few Royal Wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at one of his recent weddings there......enjoy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....with more at the album link here (for added inspiration :) &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Royal Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790079774_o.jpg\" alt=\"10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209284073_o.jpg\" alt=\"10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10449993_10152516866684487_179769906944827270_o.jpg\" alt=\"10449993_10152516866684487_1797699069448\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878037,"PostDate":1415519274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thx for sharing your review, beachgirl14 - it's what makes this forum such a valuable planning resource <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> would love to see some of your wedding photos - if you have time to share.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's a few Royal Wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at one of his recent weddings there......enjoy!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....with more at the album link here (for added inspiration <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Royal Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-a-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790079774_o.jpg\" alt=\"10505240_10152516860859487_4312839220790\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-atl.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209284073_o.jpg\" alt=\"10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-a-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/10449993_10152516866684487_179769906944827270_o.jpg\" alt=\"10449993_10152516866684487_1797699069448\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing everyone happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
